contentText:
In 2026, Universal Music Japan&#8217;s president and CEO, Naoshi Fujikura, was chosen for inclusion in Billboard &#8216;s Global Power Players list for a sixth consecutive time, making this his seventh appearance. In this year’s interview, he talked to Billboard JAPAN about Japan’s unique superfan culture and the challenges Japan faces in its overseas expansion.

